# LF everywhere, in the index and in the working tree.
#
# The pack was once checked out through Git-for-Windows' core.autocrlf=true, so every
# text file landed as CRLF and diffs against upstream were 100% noise. eol=lf overrides
# autocrlf on checkout, so the bytes on disk are the same on every platform — which is
# also what packwiz's index.toml sha256 hashes need.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.ogg binary
